description: Rasd project rules
alwaysApply: true
---

You are working on Rasd, an AI agent for after-sales motor insurance service
tickets. Read CLAUDE.md, docs/spec.md and docs/ROADMAP.md before changing code,
and check the GitHub issue for the current round.

- Never let anything reach an insurer, or a payment link reach a customer,
  without the staff approval interrupt.
- Keep business rules in app/services/ free of I/O and fully tested.
- Talk to insurers only through the InsurerChannel interface in app/integrations/.
- Every new behaviour gets a pytest test; run `pytest -q` and `ruff check .`.
- After a significant prompt, add an entry to docs/ai-dev-log.md.
